msgid "A modern compatibility tools manager"
msgstr "一个现代的兼容性工具管理器"

#: data/com.vysp3r.ProtonPlus.metainfo.xml.in:10
msgid ""
"ProtonPlus is a simple tool to help you manage your compatibility tools for "
"Steam, Lutris, Heroic Games Launcher and Bottles."
msgstr ""
"ProtonPlus 是一款简单的工具，可帮助您管理 Steam、Lutris、Heroic Games Launcher 和 Bottles"
" 的兼容性工具。"

#: data/com.vysp3r.ProtonPlus.metainfo.xml.in:13
msgid "Features:"
msgstr "功能："

#: data/com.vysp3r.ProtonPlus.metainfo.xml.in:15
msgid "Manage supported compatibility tools across supported launchers"
msgstr "管理受支持启动器中受支持的兼容性工具"

#: data/com.vysp3r.ProtonPlus.metainfo.xml.in:16
msgid "Change the compatibility tool and launch options of your Steam games"
msgstr "更改 Steam 游戏的兼容性工具和启动选项"

