msgid "🐛 Fixed Lutris install directory for Proton runners"
msgstr "🐛 修复了 Proton 运行器的 Lutris 安装目录"

#: data/com.vysp3r.ProtonPlus.metainfo.xml.in:184
msgid "🐛 Fixed unnecessary re-downloads of the same runner as an \"update\""
msgstr "🐛 修复了将同一运行程序不必要地重新下载为“更新”的问题"

