msgid "✨ Added Proton-GE RTSP Latest"
msgstr "✨ 新增了最新版本的 Proton-GE RTSP"

#: data/com.vysp3r.ProtonPlus.metainfo.xml.in:198
msgid "🐛 Fixed network error not being displayed when they should"
msgstr "🐛 修复了网络错误未按预期显示的问题"

#: data/com.vysp3r.ProtonPlus.metainfo.xml.in:199
msgid "🐛 Fixed \"Unknown error\" dialog appearing on successful update"
msgstr "🐛 修复了更新成功后出现的“未知错误”对话框"

#: data/com.vysp3r.ProtonPlus.metainfo.xml.in:200
msgid ""
"🐛 Fixed \"Games\" tab runners not refreshing when installing/removing a "
