msgstr "已禁用"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/audio-options-group.vala:38
msgid "WINEALSA Channels"
msgstr "WINEALSA 频道"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/audio-options-group.vala:39
msgid ""
"Sets the number of ALSA output channels used by Wine. Available from GE-"
"Proton11-1."
msgstr "设置 Wine 使用的 ALSA 输出通道数。可从 GE-Proton11-1 获取。"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/audio-options-group.vala:52
msgid "WINEALSA Spatial Audio"
msgstr "WINEALSA 空间音频"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/audio-options-group.vala:53
msgid ""
"Enables spatial mixing in Wine ALSA audio output. Requires WINEALSA Channels "
"set to 4, 6, or 8. Available from GE-Proton11-1."
msgstr ""
"启用 Wine ALSA 音频输出的空间混音功能。需要将 WINEALSA 通道设置为 4、6 或 8。可从 GE-Proton11-1 获取。"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/common-options-group.vala:13
msgid "Common options"
msgstr "常用选项"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/common-options-group.vala:14
msgid "Quick toggles for the launch options people reach for most often."
msgstr "最常用启动选项的快捷切换开关。"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/common-options-group.vala:17
msgid "Performance overlay"
msgstr "性能叠加层"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/common-options-group.vala:18
msgid "Shows an in-game overlay with FPS, CPU/GPU usage, and temps."
msgstr "在游戏内显示帧率、CPU/GPU 使用率和温度等信息。"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/common-options-group.vala:30
msgid "Disable Steam Deck Mode"
msgstr "禁用 Steam Deck 模式"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/common-options-group.vala:30
msgid "Disables the Steam Deck-specific profile that some games use."
msgstr "禁用某些游戏使用的 Steam Deck 特定配置文件。"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/common-options-group.vala:32
msgid "Wayland"
msgstr "Wayland 原生支持"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/common-options-group.vala:32
msgid ""
"Runs the game natively on Wayland instead of through XWayland but it breaks "
"Steam Input and the Steam Overlay."
msgstr ""
"游戏在 Wayland 上原生运行，而不是通过 XWayland 运行，但这会破坏 Steam 输入和 "
"Steam 界面。"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/common-options-group.vala:34
#: src/widgets/preferences/preferences-dialog.vala:340
msgid "Feral Gamemode"
msgstr "Feral Gamemode"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/common-options-group.vala:34
msgid ""
"Requests temporary optimizations for system performance (CPU governor, "
"process priority) when the game is running."
msgstr "游戏运行时，请求对系统性能进行临时优化（CPU调速器、进程优先级）。"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/dxvk-options-group.vala:12
msgid "DXVK options"
msgstr "DXVK 选项"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/dxvk-options-group.vala:13
#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/more-options-group.vala:20
#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/vkd3d-options-group.vala:14
msgid "Extra graphics settings and launch behaviors."
msgstr "额外的图形设置和启动行为。"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/dxvk-options-group.vala:16
msgid "DXVK Async"
msgstr "DXVK 异步"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/dxvk-options-group.vala:17
msgid ""
"Enables DXVK's asynchronous pipeline compilation which can reduce stuttering."
msgstr "启用 DXVK 的异步管道编译。这可以减少卡顿。"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/dxvk-options-group.vala:21
msgid "Disable DXVK logging"
msgstr "禁用 DXVK 日志记录"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/dxvk-options-group.vala:22
msgid ""
"Sets DXVK's log level to none which can improve performance in some games."
msgstr "将 DXVK 的日志级别设置为“无”。这可以提高某些游戏的性能。"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/dxvk-options-group.vala:26
msgid "DXVK Frame Limit"
msgstr "DXVK 帧率限制"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/dxvk-options-group.vala:27
msgid "Caps the frame rate using DXVK's built-in frame limiter."
msgstr "使用 DXVK 内置的帧限制器限制帧速率。"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/dxvk-options-group.vala:28
#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/wrappers/gamescope.vala:42
#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/wrappers/scopebuddy.vala:53
msgid "FPS"
msgstr "FPS"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/game-arguments-group.vala:14
msgid "Game arguments"
msgstr "游戏参数"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/game-arguments-group.vala:15
msgid "Flags passed directly to the game."
msgstr "直接传递给游戏的参数。"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/game-arguments-group.vala:17
msgid "Skip launcher"
msgstr "跳过启动器"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/game-arguments-group.vala:17
msgid "Adds -skip-launcher to bypass launchers in games that support it."
msgstr "添加 -skip-launcher 参数，用于在支持该参数的游戏中跳过启动器。"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/game-arguments-group.vala:18
#: src/widgets/mangohud/mangohud-performance-page.vala:44
msgid "Vulkan"
msgstr "Vulkan"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/game-arguments-group.vala:18
msgid "Adds -vulkan to make the game use its Vulkan renderer."
msgstr "添加 -vulkan 参数以使游戏使用 Vulkan 渲染器"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/game-arguments-group.vala:19
msgid "DirectX 11"
msgstr "DirectX 11"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/game-arguments-group.vala:19
msgid "Adds -dx11 to make the game use its DirectX 11 renderer."
msgstr "添加 -dx11 参数以使游戏使用 DirectX 11 渲染器"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/game-arguments-group.vala:20
msgid "DirectX 12"
msgstr "DirectX 12"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/game-arguments-group.vala:20
msgid "Adds -dx12 to make the game use its DirectX 12 renderer."
msgstr "添加 -dx12 参数以使游戏使用 DirectX 12 渲染器"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/game-arguments-group.vala:21
msgid "Console"
msgstr "控制台"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/game-arguments-group.vala:21
msgid "Adds -console to open the game's developer console when supported."
msgstr "添加 -console 参数，以便打开支持的游戏的开发者控制台。"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/gpu-vendor-amd-options-group.vala:23
msgid "Mesa Anti-Lag"
msgstr "Mesa 抗延迟"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/gpu-vendor-amd-options-group.vala:23
msgid "Reduces latency on supported AMD Mesa setups."
msgstr "降低支持的 AMD Mesa 配置的延迟。"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/gpu-vendor-amd-options-group.vala:24
msgid "Use dGPU"
msgstr "使用独显"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/gpu-vendor-amd-options-group.vala:24
msgid "Makes the game use the AMD dGPU on hybrid systems."
msgstr "使游戏在混合系统上使用 AMD 独显。"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/gpu-vendor-amd-options-group.vala:25
msgid "Hide AMD APU"
msgstr "伪装 AMD 加速处理器（APU）"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/gpu-vendor-amd-options-group.vala:25
msgid ""
"Makes Proton report an AMD APU as a discrete GPU for games that mis-detect "
"integrated graphics."
msgstr "使 Proton 将 AMD APU 报告为独立显卡，以解决游戏错误检测集成显卡的问题。"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/gpu-vendor-amd-options-group.vala:26
msgid "FSR 4 Upgrade"
msgstr "升级到 FSR 4"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/gpu-vendor-amd-options-group.vala:26
msgid ""
"Upgrades FSR 3.1 to FSR 4 in supported games. This option also disables AMD "
"Anti-Lag 2 currently due to various issues."
msgstr ""
"在支持的游戏中将 FSR 3.1 升级到 FSR 4。由于存在各种问题，此选项目前还会禁用 "
"AMD Anti-Lag 2。"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/gpu-vendor-amd-options-group.vala:31
msgid "FSR 4 RDNA3 Upgrade"
msgstr "升级到 FSR 4 RDNA3"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/gpu-vendor-amd-options-group.vala:31
msgid "Optimizes FSR 4.0 for RDNA3 hardware."
msgstr "为 RDNA3 硬件优化 FSR 4.0。"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/gpu-vendor-amd-options-group.vala:36
msgid "Staging shared memory"
msgstr "暂存共享内存"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/gpu-vendor-amd-options-group.vala:36
msgid ""
"Enables shared memory support in the AMD GPU driver for better performance "
"in some games."
msgstr "启用AMD GPU驱动程序中的共享内存支持，以在某些游戏中获得更好的性能。"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/gpu-vendor-amd-options-group.vala:37
msgid "Mesa GLThread"
msgstr "Mesa GLThread"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/gpu-vendor-amd-options-group.vala:37
msgid ""
"Enables Mesa's GLThread optimization for better performance in some games."
msgstr "启用 Mesa 的 GLThread 优化，以提高某些游戏的性能。"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/gpu-vendor-amd-options-group.vala:38
msgid "Disable Mesa shader cache"
msgstr "禁用 Mesa 着色器缓存"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/gpu-vendor-amd-options-group.vala:38
msgid "Disables Mesa's shader cache which can cause stuttering in some games."
msgstr "禁用 Mesa 着色器缓存。这可能会导致某些游戏出现卡顿。"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/gpu-vendor-amd-options-group.vala:57
msgid ""
"Configure RADV debug options for troubleshooting and performance testing."
msgstr "配置 RADV 调试选项，以便进行故障排除和性能测试。"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/gpu-vendor-amd-options-group.vala:58
msgid ""
"Configure RADV performance test options for testing experimental driver "
"features. Use with caution as these features can cause instability or other "
"issues."
msgstr "配置 RADV 性能测试选项，以测试实验性驱动程序功能。请谨慎使用，因为这些功能可能会导致系统不稳定或其他问题。"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/gpu-vendor-amd-options-group.vala:59
msgid ""
"Select which AMD Vulkan driver to use. This can be used to switch between "
"RADV and AMD's official Vulkan driver on supported systems."
msgstr "选择要使用的 AMD Vulkan 驱动程序。这可用于在支持的系统上切换 RADV 驱动程序和 AMD 官方 Vulkan 驱动程序。"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/gpu-vendor-amd-options-group.vala:60
msgid ""
"Configure ACO compiler debug options to troubleshoot shader compilation "
"issues, fix in-game stuttering, or analyze graphics performance. Use with "
"caution."
msgstr "配置 ACO 编译器调试选项，以排查着色器编译问题、修复游戏内卡顿或分析图形性能。谨慎使用。"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/gpu-vendor-intel-options-group.vala:10
msgid "XeSS Upgrade"
msgstr "升级 XeSS"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/gpu-vendor-intel-options-group.vala:10
msgid "Upgrades XeSS in supported games."
msgstr "为支持的游戏升级 XeSS。"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/gpu-vendor-nvidia-options-group.vala:18
msgid "NVAPI"
msgstr "NVAPI"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/gpu-vendor-nvidia-options-group.vala:18
msgid "Lets games access NVIDIA-specific features like DLSS."
msgstr "让游戏能够使用 NVIDIA 特有的功能，比如 DLSS。"

#. gpu_vendor_bindings.append (new LaunchOptionBinding ({ "PROTON_ENABLE_NVAPI=1" }, nvapi_tile.toggle));
#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/gpu-vendor-nvidia-options-group.vala:23
msgid "Update DLSS components"
msgstr "更新 DLSS 组件"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/gpu-vendor-nvidia-options-group.vala:23
msgid "Auto upgrades DLSS components for supported games."
msgstr "为支持的游戏自动升级 DLSS 组件。"

#. gpu_vendor_bindings.append (new LaunchOptionBinding ({ "PROTON_ENABLE_NGX_UPDATER=1" }, nvidia_ngx_updater_tile.toggle));
#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/gpu-vendor-nvidia-options-group.vala:28
msgid "Hide NVIDIA GPU"
msgstr "伪装 NVIDIA 显卡"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/gpu-vendor-nvidia-options-group.vala:28
msgid ""
"Makes Proton report an NVIDIA GPU as AMD for games that expect Windows-only "
"NVIDIA driver behavior."
msgstr ""
"让 Proton 将 NVIDIA GPU 报告为 AMD GPU，以应对那些仅预期 Windows 版 NVIDIA 驱"
"动行为的游戏。"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/gpu-vendor-nvidia-options-group.vala:29
msgid "DLSS Indicator"
msgstr "DLSS 指示器"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/gpu-vendor-nvidia-options-group.vala:29
msgid "Shows a DLSS status indicator in-game."
msgstr "在游戏内显示 DLSS 状态指示器。"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/gpu-vendor-nvidia-options-group.vala:30
msgid "NVIDIA Libraries"
msgstr "NVIDIA 运行库"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/gpu-vendor-nvidia-options-group.vala:30
msgid ""
"Enables NVIDIA-specific libraries (PhysX, CUDA). This is not needed for DLSS "
"or ray tracing."
msgstr "启用 NVIDIA 专用库（PhysX、CUDA）。DLSS 或光线追踪不需要此项。"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/gpu-vendor-options-group.vala:23
msgid "GPU vendor options"
msgstr "GPU 供应商选项"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/gpu-vendor-options-group.vala:27
msgid ""
"Use GPU-specific compatibility toggles for AMD, NVIDIA and Intel hardware."
msgstr "使用针对 AMD、NVIDIA 和 Intel 硬件的 GPU 特定兼容性开关。"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/gpu-vendor-options-group.vala:53
msgid "AMD"
msgstr "AMD"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/gpu-vendor-options-group.vala:54
msgid "NVIDIA"
msgstr "NVIDIA"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/gpu-vendor-options-group.vala:55
msgid "Intel"
msgstr "Intel"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/more-options-group.vala:19
msgid "More options"
msgstr "更多选项"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/more-options-group.vala:22
msgid "VKBasalt"
msgstr "VKBasalt"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/more-options-group.vala:22
msgid "Adds visual effects like sharpening and color adjustments."
msgstr "添加锐化和色彩调整等视觉效果。"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/more-options-group.vala:23
msgid "WineD3D"
msgstr "WineD3D"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/more-options-group.vala:23
msgid ""
"Uses OpenGL instead of Vulkan. Only enable if you're having DXVK issues."
msgstr "使用 OpenGL 而非 Vulkan。仅当 DXVK 出现问题时才启用。"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/more-options-group.vala:24
msgid "Use FSync"
msgstr "使用 FSync"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/more-options-group.vala:24
msgid ""
"Uses FSync instead of NTSync. Can fix issues in certain games that do not "
"pair well with NTSync."
msgstr "使用 FSync 而非 NTSync。可以修复某些与 NTSync 兼容性不佳的游戏出现的问题。"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/more-options-group.vala:25
msgid "Local shader cache"
msgstr "局部着色器缓存"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/more-options-group.vala:25
msgid ""
"Enables per-game shader cache. This isolates the shader cache of each game "
"but does not compile them ahead-of-time."
msgstr "启用游戏级着色器缓存。这会隔离每个游戏的着色器缓存，但不会预先编译它们。"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/more-options-group.vala:26
msgid "Prefer SDL controller"
msgstr "SDL 控制器偏好"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/more-options-group.vala:26
msgid "Workaround for controller detection issues."
msgstr "解决控制器检测问题的变通方案。"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/more-options-group.vala:27
msgid "Disable Steam Input"
msgstr "禁用 Steam Input"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/more-options-group.vala:27
msgid "Disables Steam Input support. Fixes Wayland controller/gamepad issues."
msgstr "禁用 Steam Input 支持。修复 Wayland 控制器/游戏手柄问题。"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/more-options-group.vala:28
msgid "WINE_VK_USE_SYNC2"
msgstr "WINE_VK_USE_SYNC2"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/more-options-group.vala:28
msgid ""
"Enables WINE_VK_USE_SYNC2 which can improve performance and reduce "
"stuttering in some games when using WineD3D."
msgstr "启用 WINE_VK_USE_SYNC2，这可以提高性能并减少在使用 WineD3D 时某些游戏的卡顿现象。"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/more-options-group.vala:29
msgid "WINE_SYNC_USE_FUTEX_WAITV"
msgstr "WINE_SYNC_USE_FUTEX_WAITV"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/more-options-group.vala:29
msgid ""
"Enables WINE_SYNC_USE_FUTEX_WAITV which can improve performance and reduce "
"stuttering in some games when using WineD3D."
msgstr "启用 WINE_SYNC_USE_FUTEX_WAITV，这可以提高性能并减少在使用 WineD3D 时某些游戏的卡顿现象。"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/more-options-group.vala:30
msgid "Simulate Write-Copy Memory"
msgstr "模拟写复制存储器"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/more-options-group.vala:30
msgid ""
"Forces Wine to simulate page-write protection, fixing initialization errors "
"in certain older titles."
msgstr "强制 Wine 模拟页面写入保护，修复某些旧版本中的初始化错误。"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/proton-options-group.vala:18
msgid "Proton options"
msgstr "Proton 选项"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/proton-options-group.vala:19
msgid "Extra Proton settings and launch behaviors."
msgstr "更多 Proton 设置和启动行为。"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/proton-options-group.vala:21
msgid "Higher priority for games"
msgstr "更高游戏优先级"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/proton-options-group.vala:21
msgid ""
"Gives the game a higher CPU priority which can improve performance in some "
"cases."
msgstr "赋予游戏更高的 CPU 优先级，这在某些情况下可以提高性能。"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/proton-options-group.vala:22
msgid "Use WoW64"
msgstr "使用 WoW64"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/proton-options-group.vala:22
msgid ""
"Enables WoW64 support for 32-bit games on 64-bit Proton builds. This can "
"improve compatibility for some older games."
msgstr "为 64 位 Proton 构建版本上的 32 位游戏启用 WoW64 支持。这可以提高某些老游戏的兼容性。"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/proton-options-group.vala:23
msgid "Allows 32-bit games to use more than 2GB of RAM"
msgstr "允许 32 位游戏使用超过 2GB 的内存"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/proton-options-group.vala:23
msgid ""
"Forces 32-bit games to use large address aware which can improve performance "
"and stability."
msgstr "强制 32 位游戏启用“大地址感知”（Large Address Aware），可提升性能与稳定性。"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/proton-options-group.vala:24
msgid "Enable Proton logs"
msgstr "启用 Proton 日志"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/proton-options-group.vala:24
msgid ""
"Enables logging for Proton which can help with troubleshooting game issues. "
"Logs are saved in the game's compatibility data folder."
msgstr "启用 Proton 日志记录功能，有助于排查游戏问题。日志保存在游戏兼容性数据文件夹中。"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/proton-options-group.vala:25
msgid "Enable Proton OptiScaler"
msgstr "启用 Proton OptiScaler"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/proton-options-group.vala:25
msgid ""
"Enables the Proton OptiScaler which can improve performance and image "
"quality for some games (Available from version 11-1)."
msgstr "启用 Proton OptiScaler，可以提高某些游戏的性能和图像质量（11-1 版本起可用）。"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/proton-options-group.vala:26
msgid "Enable Proton Discord Bridge"
msgstr "启用 Proton Discord Bridge"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/proton-options-group.vala:26
msgid ""
"Enables the Proton Discord Bridge which can improve integration with Discord "
"for some games (Available from version 11-1)."
msgstr "启用 Proton Discord Bridge，可以改善与 Discord 的集成。适用于某些游戏（11-1 版本起可用）。"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/proton-options-group.vala:27
msgid "Use D7VK"
msgstr "使用 D7VK"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/proton-options-group.vala:27
msgid ""
"Enables the use of D7VK which can improve performance and compatibility for "
"some Direct3D 9 games (Available from version 11-1)."
msgstr "启用 D7VK，可提高部分 Direct3D 9 游戏的性能和兼容性（版本 11-1 及更高版本可用）。"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/vkd3d-options-group.vala:13
msgid "VKD3D options"
msgstr "VKD3D 选项"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/vkd3d-options-group.vala:20
#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-options-editor-vkd3d-config.vala:47
msgid "Configure Direct3D 12 to Vulkan translation behavior"
msgstr "配置 Direct3D 12 到 Vulkan 的转换行为"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/vkd3d-options-group.vala:26
#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-options-editor-vkd3d-log-level.vala:21
msgid "VKD3D Logging Level"
msgstr "VKD3D 日志级别"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/vkd3d-options-group.vala:29
msgid "Enable VKD3D GPUVA"
msgstr "启用 VKD3D GPU 虚拟寻址"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/vkd3d-options-group.vala:30
msgid ""
"Enables GPU Virtual Addressing. Aligns Vulkan memory management with native "
"DX12 behavior to improve texture streaming and stability in open-world games."
msgstr "启用 GPU 虚拟寻址。使 Vulkan 内存管理与原生 DX12 行为保持一致，从而改善开放世界游戏中的纹理流传输和稳定性。"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/vkd3d-options-group.vala:34
msgid "Enable VKD3D Shader Cache"
msgstr "启用 VKD3D 着色器缓存"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/vkd3d-options-group.vala:35
msgid ""
"Enables VKD3D's internal shader caching mechanism to minimize in-game "
"stutter."
msgstr "启用 VKD3D 的内部着色器缓存机制，以最大限度地减少游戏内卡顿。"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/wrapper-group.vala:17
msgid "Launch tools"
msgstr "启动工具"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/wrapper-group.vala:18
msgid ""
"Choose one to configure FPS caps, resolution, and other display options."
msgstr "选择其中一项来配置帧率上限、分辨率和其他显示选项。"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/wrapper-group.vala:40
#: src/widgets/mangohud/mangohud-extras-page.vala:152
#: src/widgets/mangohud/mangohud-performance-page.vala:97
#: src/widgets/mangohud/mangohud-performance-page.vala:111
#: src/widgets/mangohud/mangohud-visual-page.vala:74
msgid "None"
msgstr "无"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/wrapper-group.vala:43
#: src/widgets/preferences/preferences-dialog.vala:330
msgid "Gamescope"
msgstr "Gamescope"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/groups/wrapper-group.vala:48
#: src/widgets/preferences/preferences-dialog.vala:335
msgid "ScopeBuddy"
msgstr "ScopeBuddy"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-options-editor-aco-debug.vala:11
#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-options-editor-radv-perf-test.vala:11
#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-options-editor-vkd3d-config.vala:26
msgid "Enabled"
msgstr "已启用"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-options-editor-aco-debug.vala:15
msgid ""
"Validates the compiler's internal representation after each pass. Used for "
"driver debugging."
msgstr "每次编译后验证编译器的内部表示。用于驱动程序调试。"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-options-editor-aco-debug.vala:16
msgid ""
"Disables FP gathering optimizations. Workaround for specific texture issues "
"in older games."
msgstr "禁用FP收集优化。解决老游戏中特定纹理问题的变通方案。"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-options-editor-aco-debug.vala:17
msgid ""
"Prints detailed compilation performance stats and register usage to system "
"log."
msgstr "将详细的编译性能统计信息和寄存器使用情况打印到系统日志中。"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-options-editor-aco-debug.vala:18
msgid ""
"Forces the use of the instruction selector pass even when it could be "
"bypassed."
msgstr "强制使用指令选择器传递，即使它可以被绕过。"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-options-editor-aco-debug.vala:19
msgid ""
"Disables the instruction scheduling pass. Can help isolate compiler bugs."
msgstr "禁用指令调度过程。这有助于定位编译器错误。"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-options-editor-aco-debug.vala:20
msgid ""
"Forces Wave64 mode execution on RDNA hardware instead of the default Wave32."
msgstr "强制在 RDNA 硬件上执行 Wave64 模式，而不是默认的 Wave32 模式。"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-options-editor-aco-debug.vala:23
msgid "AMD ACO Debug Options"
msgstr "AMD ACO 调试选项"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-options-editor-aco-debug.vala:24
msgid "Fine-tune AMD ACO shader compiler behavior"
msgstr "微调 AMD ACO 着色器编译器行为"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-options-editor-aco-debug.vala:25
msgid "Enable ACO Debug"
msgstr "启用 ACO 调试"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-options-editor-aco-debug.vala:26
msgid "Apply low-level shader compiler flags and overrides"
msgstr "应用底层着色器编译器标志和覆盖"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-options-editor-amd-icd.vala:11
#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-options-editor-vkd3d-log-level.vala:8
msgid "System Default"
msgstr "系统默认"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-options-editor-amd-icd.vala:19
msgid "Switch between open-source Mesa driver and official AMDVLK driver."
msgstr "在开源 Mesa 驱动程序和官方 AMDVLK 驱动程序之间切换。"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-options-editor-amd-icd.vala:22
msgid "AMD Vulkan ICD Driver"
msgstr "AMD Vulkan ICD 驱动程序"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-options-editor-amd-icd.vala:23
msgid "Select preferred Vulkan driver implementation"
msgstr "选择首选的 Vulkan 驱动程序实现"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-options-editor-amd-icd.vala:24
msgid "Force Vulkan Driver"
msgstr "强制 Vulkan 驱动程序"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-options-editor-amd-icd.vala:25
msgid "Override system-wide Vulkan driver preference for this game"
msgstr "为该游戏覆盖系统范围的 Vulkan 驱动程序首选项"

#. Launch command preview
#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-options-editor-box.vala:30
msgid "Launch command preview"
msgstr "启动命令预览"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-options-editor-custom-expander-row.vala:35
msgid "Add custom item (Type name and press Enter)..."
msgstr "添加自定义项目（输入名称并按回车键）……"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-options-editor-dll-overrides.vala:46
msgid ".NET Framework runtime execution engine"
msgstr ".NET Framework 运行时执行引擎"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-options-editor-dll-overrides.vala:47
msgid "Direct3D 9 graphics API (often overridden for mods/wrappers)"
msgstr "Direct3D 9 图形 API（通常会被 mods/封装器覆盖）"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-options-editor-dll-overrides.vala:48
msgid "Direct3D 10 graphics API library"
msgstr "Direct3D 10 图形 API 库"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-options-editor-dll-overrides.vala:49
msgid "Direct3D 11 graphics API library (DXVK)"
msgstr "Direct3D 11 图形 API 库 (DXVK)"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-options-editor-dll-overrides.vala:50
msgid "Direct3D 12 graphics API layer (VKD3D)"
msgstr "Direct3D 12 图形 API 层 (VKD3D)"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-options-editor-dll-overrides.vala:51
msgid "Wine's internal OpenGL-based DirectX translator"
msgstr "Wine 的内部基于 OpenGL 的 DirectX 转换器"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-options-editor-dll-overrides.vala:52
msgid "Special D3D9 to OpenGL translation wrapper"
msgstr "特殊的 D3D9 到 OpenGL 转换封装器"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-options-editor-dll-overrides.vala:53
msgid "Microsoft HLSL Shader Compiler (fixes shader crashes)"
msgstr "Microsoft HLSL 着色器编译器（修复着色器崩溃问题）"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-options-editor-dll-overrides.vala:54
msgid "DirectX Graphics Infrastructure (required for ReShade/SpecialK)"
msgstr "DirectX 图形基础架构（ReShade/SpecialK 必需）"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-options-editor-dll-overrides.vala:55
msgid "DirectSound library (fixes audio mixing and 3D sound)"
msgstr "DirectSound 库（修复音频混合和 3D 音效问题）"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-options-editor-dll-overrides.vala:56
msgid "DirectDraw (critical for older 2D/3D games and patches)"
msgstr "DirectDraw（对较旧的 2D/3D 游戏和补丁至关重要）"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-options-editor-dll-overrides.vala:57
msgid "MSHTML web rendering engine for built-in game launchers"
msgstr "用于内置游戏启动器的 MSHTML 网页渲染引擎"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-options-editor-dll-overrides.vala:58
msgid "XAudio 2.7 audio library (fixes crackling or missing sound)"
msgstr "XAudio 2.7 音频库（修复爆音或声音缺失问题）"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-options-editor-dll-overrides.vala:59
msgid "XAudio 2.9 audio library for modern Windows 10/11 games"
msgstr "适用于现代 Windows 10/11 游戏的 XAudio 2.9 音频库"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-options-editor-dll-overrides.vala:60
msgid "OpenAL 3D Audio library (enables hardware sound acceleration)"
msgstr "OpenAL 3D 音频库（启用硬件声音加速）"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-options-editor-dll-overrides.vala:61
msgid "DirectInput 8 (commonly used to inject scripts/ASI mod loaders)"
msgstr "DirectInput 8（通常用于注入脚本/ASI mod 加载器）"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-options-editor-dll-overrides.vala:62
msgid "Windows Internet HTTP API (fixes network connectivity in launchers)"
msgstr "Windows Internet HTTP API（修复启动器中的网络连接问题）"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-options-editor-dll-overrides.vala:63
msgid "OLE Monkers library for URL handling and launcher updates"
msgstr "OLE Monkers 库用于 URL 处理和启动器更新"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-options-editor-dll-overrides.vala:64
msgid "Windows Internet API layer (fixes online features in game launchers)"
msgstr "Windows Internet API 层（修复游戏启动器中的在线功能）"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-options-editor-dll-overrides.vala:65
msgid "Bink Video 32-bit decoder (fixes intro movie crashes)"
msgstr "Bink Video 32 位解码器（修复片头影片崩溃问题）"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-options-editor-dll-overrides.vala:66
msgid "Bink Video 64-bit decoder (fixes intro movie crashes in modern games)"
msgstr "Bink Video 64 位解码器（修复现代游戏中开场动画崩溃的问题）"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-options-editor-dll-overrides.vala:67
msgid "Graphics Device Interface (helps with custom fonts and rendering)"
msgstr "Graphics Device Interface（帮助自定义字体和渲染）"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-options-editor-dll-overrides.vala:68
msgid ""
"Uniscribe Script Processor (fixes Asian text / custom localization rendering)"
msgstr "Uniscribe Script Processor（修复亚洲文本/自定义翻译渲染问题）"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-options-editor-dll-overrides.vala:69
msgid "Common Controls Library (needed for custom game launchers)"
msgstr "Common Controls Library（自定义游戏启动器需要）"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-options-editor-dll-overrides.vala:72
msgid "Wine DLL Overrides"
msgstr "Wine DLL 覆盖设置"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-options-editor-dll-overrides.vala:73
msgid "Manage library overrides (builtin/native)"
msgstr "管理库覆盖设置（内置/原生）"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-options-editor-dll-overrides.vala:74
msgid "Enable DLL Overrides"
msgstr "启用 DLL 覆盖设置"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-options-editor-dll-overrides.vala:75
msgid "Bypass or prefer specific Windows DLLs"
msgstr "绕过或优先使用特定的 Windows DLL 文件"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-options-editor-radv-debug.vala:11
msgid "Enabled (Enforce)"
msgstr "已启用（强制执行）"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-options-editor-radv-debug.vala:15
msgid "Disables Next-Gen Geometry (NGG). Fixes crashes in older Vulkan games."
msgstr "禁用 Next-Gen Geometry（NGG）。修复旧版 Vulkan 游戏崩溃的问题。"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-options-editor-radv-debug.vala:16
msgid "Disables internal application binary interface caching."
msgstr "禁用内部应用程序二进制接口缓存。"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-options-editor-radv-debug.vala:17
msgid "Disables background shader compilation."
msgstr "禁用后台着色器编译。"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-options-editor-radv-debug.vala:18
msgid "Disables Delta Color Compression. Can fix specific rendering artifacts."
msgstr "禁用 Delta 颜色压缩。可以修复特定的渲染瑕疵。"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-options-editor-radv-debug.vala:19
msgid "Disables Variable Rate Shading (VRS). Fixes UI artifacts in some games."
msgstr "禁用可变速率着色（VRS）。修复部分游戏中出现的 UI 问题。"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-options-editor-radv-debug.vala:20
msgid ""
"Disables Graphics Pipeline Library (GPL) to troubleshoot startup crashes."
msgstr "禁用 Graphics Pipeline Library (GPL) 以排查启动崩溃问题。"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-options-editor-radv-debug.vala:21
msgid "Forces fallback command submission mode. Helps diagnosing GPU hangs."
msgstr "强制使用备用命令提交模式。有助于诊断 GPU 挂起问题。"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-options-editor-radv-debug.vala:22
msgid "Disables Vertex Runtime Shading. Can fix specific rendering artifacts."
msgstr "禁用 Vertex Runtime Shading，可修复特定的渲染异常。"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-options-editor-radv-debug.vala:23
msgid ""
"Precompiles shaders during loading screens to reduce in-game stuttering."
msgstr "在加载画面期间预编译着色器，以减少游戏内卡顿。"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-options-editor-radv-debug.vala:24
msgid ""
"Disables AMD Texture Compression. Fixes texture glitches on APUs and Steam "
"Deck."
msgstr "禁用 AMD 纹理压缩。这可以修复 APU 和 Steam Deck 平台上的纹理错误。"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-options-editor-radv-debug.vala:27
msgid "AMD RADV Debug Options"
msgstr "AMD RADV 调试选项"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-options-editor-radv-debug.vala:28
msgid "Fine-tune AMD Radeon Vulkan driver behavior"
msgstr "微调 AMD Radeon Vulkan 驱动程序行为"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-options-editor-radv-debug.vala:29
msgid "Enable RADV Debug"
msgstr "启用 RADV 调试"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-options-editor-radv-debug.vala:30
msgid "Apply low-level driver bugfixes and overrides"
msgstr "应用底层驱动修复补丁及覆盖设置"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-options-editor-radv-perf-test.vala:15
msgid "Enables experimental hardware Ray Tracing support."
msgstr "启用实验性硬件光线追踪支持。"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-options-editor-radv-perf-test.vala:16
msgid "Optimizes Smart Access Memory / Resizable BAR utilization."
msgstr "优化 Smart Access Memory / Resizable BAR 的使用。"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-options-editor-radv-perf-test.vala:17
msgid "Enables Next-Gen Geometry Culling for better geometry performance."
msgstr "启用 Next-Gen Geometry Culling，以提升几何性能。"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-options-editor-radv-perf-test.vala:18
msgid "Graphics Pipeline Library. Drastically reduces shader stuttering."
msgstr "Graphics Pipeline Library，可大幅减少着色器编译卡顿。"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-options-editor-radv-perf-test.vala:19
msgid ""
"Enables User Space Queue submission. Can improve CPU-bound game performance "
"on modern kernels."
msgstr "启用 User Space Queue Submission，可提升现代内核下 CPU 密集型游戏的性能。"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-options-editor-radv-perf-test.vala:20
msgid ""
"Emulates hardware Ray Tracing using software compute shaders on AMD GPUs. "
"Enables RT features on unsupported hardware at the cost of a drastic "
"performance drop."
msgstr "在 AMD GPU 上使用软件计算着色器模拟硬件光线追踪。这可实现在不支持的硬件上使用光线追踪，但性能会大幅下降。"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-options-editor-radv-perf-test.vala:23
msgid "AMD RADV Performance Tests"
msgstr "AMD RADV 性能测试"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-options-editor-radv-perf-test.vala:24
msgid "Enable experimental AMD performance features"
msgstr "启用实验性 AMD 性能功能"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-options-editor-radv-perf-test.vala:25
msgid "Enable RADV Perftest"
msgstr "启用 RADV 性能测试"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-options-editor-radv-perf-test.vala:26
msgid "Test bleeding-edge driver optimizations (use with caution)"
msgstr "测试最新的驱动程序优化（谨慎使用）"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-options-editor-resolution-field.vala:37
msgid "Auto detect"
msgstr "自动检测"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-options-editor-resolution-field.vala:38
#: src/widgets/mangohud/mangohud-presets-page.vala:26
#: src/widgets/mangohud/mangohud-presets-page.vala:54
msgid "Custom"
msgstr "自定义"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-options-editor-resolution-field.vala:69
#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-options-editor-spin-tile.vala:44
msgid "Set"
msgstr "设置"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-options-editor-resolution-field.vala:70
msgid "Apply the custom resolution"
msgstr "应用自定义分辨率"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-options-editor-spin-tile.vala:45
msgid "Apply the FPS value"
msgstr "应用 FPS 值"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-options-editor-vkd3d-config.vala:30
msgid ""
"Enables VKD3D's internal shader cache on disk. Drastically reduces micro-"
"stuttering and speeds up consecutive loading times."
msgstr "启用 VKD3D 的磁盘内部着色器缓存。大幅减少微卡顿，加快连续加载速度。"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-options-editor-vkd3d-config.vala:31
msgid ""
"Forces VKD3D to use system RAM instead of VRAM for caching shader "
"compilation data, ensuring smoother data stream between CPU and GPU."
msgstr "强制 VKD3D 使用系统内存而非显存来缓存着色器编译数据，从而确保 CPU 和 GPU 之间更流畅的数据流。"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-options-editor-vkd3d-config.vala:32
msgid ""
"Uses host-visible VRAM for staging buffers. Drastically reduces stuttering "
"if Resizable BAR / SAM is enabled."
msgstr "为暂存缓冲区使用主机可见的显存。若已启用 Resizable BAR / SAM，可大幅减少卡顿。"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-options-editor-vkd3d-config.vala:33
msgid ""
"Disables host-visible VRAM staging buffers. Use as a compatibility fallback "
"if experiencing memory-related crashes."
msgstr "禁用主机可见的显存暂存缓冲区。如果遇到内存相关的崩溃，可用作兼容性回退方案。"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-options-editor-vkd3d-config.vala:34
msgid ""
"Disables D3D12 Ray Tracing (DXR) capabilities entirely. Significantly "
"improves performance and stability on GPUs without strong hardware RT "
"support."
msgstr "完全禁用 D3D12 光线追踪 (DXR) 功能。显著提升在硬件光线追踪支持较弱的 GPU 上的性能和稳定性。"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-options-editor-vkd3d-config.vala:35
msgid ""
"Exposes D3D12 Ray Tracing (DXR 1.1 and 1.0) capabilities to the game via "
"Vulkan extensions."
msgstr "通过 Vulkan 扩展，向游戏开放 D3D12 光线追踪（DXR 1.1 和 1.0）功能。"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-options-editor-vkd3d-config.vala:36
msgid ""
"Restricts Ray Tracing capabilities to DXR 1.0 only. Useful for older RT "
"games that crash with DXR 1.1."
msgstr "将光线追踪功能限制为仅支持 DXR 1.0。这对于在 DXR 1.1 下会崩溃的旧版光线追踪游戏很有用。"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-options-editor-vkd3d-config.vala:37
msgid ""
"Forces Ray Tracing BVH acceleration structures to be built on the CPU "
"instead of the GPU. Severe performance impact!"
msgstr "强制在 CPU 而非 GPU 上构建光线追踪 BVH 加速结构。会严重影响性能！"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-options-editor-vkd3d-config.vala:38
msgid ""
"Aggressively unifies memory allocators for textures and buffers to save a "
"small amount of VRAM."
msgstr "激进地统一纹理和缓冲区的内存分配器，以节省少量显存。"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-options-editor-vkd3d-config.vala:39
msgid ""
"Enables advanced GPU Virtual Addressing to improve Direct3D 12 memory "
"mapping in massive open-world games."
msgstr "启用高级 GPU 虚拟寻址，以改善大型开放世界游戏中 Direct3D 12 内存映射。"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-options-editor-vkd3d-config.vala:40
msgid ""
"Disables descriptor caches. Workaround for specific games suffering from "
"memory leaks."
msgstr "禁用描述符缓存。针对特定存在内存泄漏问题的游戏的临时解决方案。"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-options-editor-vkd3d-config.vala:41
msgid ""
"Forces the GPU to maintain stable clock rates. Intended for accurate "
"benchmarking only."
msgstr "强制GPU保持稳定的时钟频率。仅用于精确的基准测试。"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-options-editor-vkd3d-config.vala:42
msgid ""
"Alters how root parameters are passed to compute shaders. Can fix specific "
"rendering glitches."
msgstr "改变根参数传递给计算着色器的方式。可以修复特定的渲染故障。"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-options-editor-vkd3d-config.vala:43
msgid ""
"Allows unaligned stencil buffer clears. Workaround for certain older "
"Direct3D 12 renderers."
msgstr "允许未对齐的模板缓冲区清除操作。针对某些较旧的 Direct3D 12 渲染器的兼容性修正。"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-options-editor-vkd3d-config.vala:46
msgid "VKD3D Proton Configurations"
msgstr "VKD3D Proton 配置"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-options-editor-vkd3d-config.vala:48
msgid "Enable VKD3D Option"
msgstr "启用 VKD3D 选项"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-options-editor-vkd3d-config.vala:49
msgid "Test specific Direct3D 12 compatibility workarounds and optimizations"
msgstr "测试针对 Direct3D 12 的特定兼容性变通方案和优化措施"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-options-editor-vkd3d-log-level.vala:22
msgid "Adjust how much debugging information VKD3D prints to the terminal."
msgstr "调整 VKD3D 输出多少调试信息到终端。"

#: src/widgets/games/launch-options-editor/launch-options-list.vala:18
msgid "No launch options configured yet."
msgstr "目前还没配置启动选项。"

